 # Evidence-First Content Research
 
 Use this class skill for WeChat articles, web essays, reports, and other externally supplied links when the user may want either analysis or durable knowledge ingestion.
+
+## Two-stage research delivery contract
+
+This stage contract governs the detailed verification and ingestion recipes below; those recipes are not prerequisites for an initial source readout. It changes execution order, not evidence or authorization standards.
+
+### Stage 1 — 原文速读
+
+- Default for a single article/link with “研究一下 / 调研一下 / 怎么看 / 看看”: use the current Hermes agent, acquire the actual source via existing extraction/cache, and give a short source readout. No automatic specialist delegation or broad external search campaign. A user explicitly requesting a specialist still controls that choice.
+- Target the first useful readout within 60 seconds when source access permits. This is a service target, not a measured guarantee or permission to invent content. Use bounded extraction and a necessary fallback; if inaccessible, report the real access/coverage blocker promptly, not a fabricated summary or a bare started acknowledgement.
+- Include title/source, one-sentence thesis, 3–5 author claims, a bounded preliminary assessment, material evidence gaps and 2–3 recommended research directions. Mark “基于原文，未完成外部交叉核验”. Do not call author statements independently verified facts. Preserve dates, units and scope; check obvious load-bearing arithmetic with execute_code. High-risk advice and current actionable recommendations need appropriate verification, not an unverified affirmative recommendation with a disclaimer.
+- Do not search an opaque URL identifier, load unrelated history, produce a long hidden report before summarizing, or invoke research_deposit/recover/status solely to finish this readout. A quick readout is not an adopted complete research artifact and creates no pre-answer deposit requirement. Keep no_save and all host consent boundaries intact.
+- End with useful continuation choices, then stop. Silence does not authorize deeper work. This stage is not the completion of an explicitly requested full investigation.
+
+### Stage 2 — 按需深研
+
+- A follow-up naming an interest point investigates that point plus its necessary premises. A clear “继续 / 深入” associated with this source follows the highest-impact gaps without another clarification. Unrelated “继续” must not be inferred as research; use only relevant Hermes conversation context and ask if the source is genuinely ambiguous.
+- An initial explicit request for full/deep research receives the short source readout as an intermediate commentary and continues the original task, without asking again. Never stop at a quick readout or claim background work exists unless Hermes actually started it.
+- Reuse the source, checked claims, citations and pending questions already available through Hermes conversation and existing cache. Retrieve missing context selectively; do not manufacture a second research runtime, writer, memory store or full-history copy.
+- Verify load-bearing facts with primary sources, test the strongest relevant counterexample and competing explanations, and classify unsupported claims honestly. Search independent questions in bounded parallel batches; read relevant passages rather than dumping every candidate page. Stop when the core conclusion and material counterevidence are covered and remaining limits are explicit, not at an arbitrary citation count.
+- Report confirmed / revised / still unknown compared with the readout. Reuse one adopted analysis rather than serially generating a child report, a near-identical deposit essay and another full answer. Independent review is risk-triggered or user-requested, not automatic for every link.
+- When authorized ingestion is part of the deep task, deliver the substantive result before administrative deposit processing (commentary if the same turn must continue), then reuse the existing adopted body through the existing research_deposit contract. Do not silently drop an authorized deep-research deposit or claim an asynchronous writer was scheduled without a real receipt. Report only actual storage/compile states. no_save forbids research persistence throughout both stages and cannot be lifted by a phase transition.
+
+Performance acceptance measures intake-to-useful-readout and intake-to-final-delivery separately. Browser smoke tests, acknowledgements, unit tests and summed parallel durations are not end-to-end latency evidence. Test source fidelity, unsupported certainty, continuation relevance and high-risk boundaries alongside speed.
 
